        "content": {
          "passageId": "english-pre-a1-m014-reading-passage-01",
          "passage": "I pack my school bag every morning. I put my reading book and notebook inside. My pencil case has a blue pen, two pencils, a rubber and a sharpener. I also take a ruler and some crayons for art. My bag is not very big, but everything I need is inside. I am ready for school!"
